{"id":"n49271-1-8","stage":5,"title":"탁월하다 · 卓越","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49271-1-8-1","ko":"비싼데도 굳이 이 화장품을 사는 이유가 뭐야?","zh":"明明这么贵，为什么还要特意买这款化妆品呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비싼데도","meaning":"昂贵，高昂","explanation":"비싸다：昂贵，高昂；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"3","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비싼데도","audio":"/audio/19661149b8ad8c5df7f1.mp3"}},{"text":"굳이","meaning":"一定，非得，非要","explanation":"굳이：一定，非得，非要","readings":[{"term":"굳이","audio":"/audio/b264f84187232732b9fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37409","senseId":"1","lemma":"굳이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굳이","audio":"/audio/b264f84187232732b9fd.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"화장품을","meaning":"化妆品","explanation":"화장품：化妆品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"화장품","audio":"/audio/740b80a0f4f8ee4087dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73232","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화장품을","audio":"/audio/9c46df752ef1fcd79520.mp3"}},{"text":"사는","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사는","audio":"/audio/30f3407ddedb23e84811.mp3"}},{"text":"이유가","meaning":"理由","explanation":"이유：理由；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이유","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62386","senseId":"1","lemma":"이유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이유가","audio":"/audio/31a72eab8830677dbc1a.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"昂贵，高昂","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"做某事的代价高于一般水准。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]},{"id":"b264f84187232732","term":"굳이","zh":"一定，非得，非要","audio":"/audio/b264f84187232732b9fd.mp3","entryId":"37409","definition":"费心、有意地。","pronunciation":["구지"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"740b80a0f4f8ee40","term":"화장품","zh":"化妆品","audio":"/audio/740b80a0f4f8ee4087dd.mp3","entryId":"73232","definition":"为了美观或护理皮肤而涂抹在脸上的物品。","pronunciation":["화장품"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"6445cb23ec9811b5","term":"이유","zh":"理由","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3","entryId":"62386","definition":"使某个结果发生的原因或根据。","pronunciation":["이ː유"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/a4b110d7b59599031b11.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49271-1-8-2","ko":"미백 효과가 탁월하거든.","zh":"因为它的美白效果非常出色啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미백","meaning":"美白","explanation":"미백：美白","readings":[{"term":"미백","audio":"/audio/1f6b4e9a8a786bb3b8cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56345","senseId":"1","lemma":"미백","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미백","audio":"/audio/1f6b4e9a8a786bb3b8cd.mp3"}},{"text":"효과가","meaning":"效果，功效，效力，成效，作用","explanation":"효과：效果，功效，效力，成效，作用；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"효과","audio":"/audio/377d1a0f2e6c609d9b7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62405","senseId":"1","lemma":"효과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"효과가","audio":"/audio/ba4bf4e01d2a198060a1.mp3"}},{"text":"탁월하거든.","meaning":"卓越，非凡，出众","explanation":"탁월하다：卓越，非凡，出众；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"탁월하다","audio":"/audio/cff4048664564031dc63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49271","senseId":"1","lemma":"탁월하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"탁월하거든","audio":"/audio/8d1178a6892c787e4d42.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1f6b4e9a8a786bb3","term":"미백","zh":"美白","audio":"/audio/1f6b4e9a8a786bb3b8cd.mp3","entryId":"56345","definition":"人为地把皮肤或牙齿变白。","pronunciation":["미ː백"]},{"id":"377d1a0f2e6c609d","term":"효과","zh":"效果，功效，效力，成效，作用","audio":"/audio/377d1a0f2e6c609d9b7b.mp3","entryId":"62405","definition":"做某事所获得的好的结果。","pronunciation":["효ː과","효ː꽈"]},{"id":"cff4048664564031","term":"탁월하다","zh":"卓越，非凡，出众","audio":"/audio/cff4048664564031dc63.mp3","entryId":"49271","definition":"比别人出色很多。","pronunciation":["타궐하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7e26f11f948f2680bf0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49271","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":169,"sequenceScore":3.3367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为它的美白效果非常出色啊。","我之前都不知道家里有这么多虫子呢。","明明这么贵，为什么还要特意买这款化妆品呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为它的美白效果非常出色啊。","明明这么贵，为什么还要特意买这款化妆品呢？","我之前都不知道家里有这么多虫子呢。"],"answer":0}]}
